; font_outline_color and outline_size, the one variable no other Label fixture sets. The MSDF
; text engine composites the outline into the fill's mesh at a second distance threshold
; (`msdfMaterial.ts`). Drawing no border, or one of the wrong width, beside a correct fill is
; invisible to a diff that checks only the fill's ink.

